.jpg","released":"2025-02-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Episodio 2","overview":"La rivalidad entre Hezekiah y Sugar se afianza, mientras Mary intensifica sus planes para el robo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jVDFgo3NglO2Te0Qkdiq2rZ0jp.jpg","released":"2025-02-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Episodio 3","overview":"Un atentado sacude Wapping, perturbando a Hezekiah y amenazando los planes de Mary y Sugar.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dey14dBNOAZkrslOzl4Wm7hIi4b.jpg","released":"2025-02-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Episodio 4","overview":"Es la noche del robo de Mary Carr, y todo está en su lugar, incluyendo a Hezekiah y Lao.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2sn6Fk7Ozk5GQUUqrkWqm5Y0RQH.jpg","released":"2025-02-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"51 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Episodio 5","overview":"Mientras Hezekiah asciende en el boxeo, Mary sufre por las acciones de Lao durante el robo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gOuaw1ASZ8vHni1c3IjG4RkxJL8.jpg","released":"2025-02-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Episodio 6","overview":"Conmocionado, Hezekiah se prepara para su pelea por el título mientras el lazo se estrecha con Mary.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rSMM8vmHPXy5aA9HIxkyFrSxAhH.jpg","released":"2025-02-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"Episodio 1","overview":"Hezekiah no es ni la sombra de lo que fue, mientras Sugar Goodson se hunde en el alcohol.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iuLAe8R5nlx9bL3ovNj7IWDbyvY.jpg","released":"2026-01-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"47 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"Episodio 2","overview":"Londres tiene asuntos pendientes con Hezekiah. Mary da el siguiente paso y una batalla se avecina.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y4qlsooZ8ee3ICPeF1xB8yn5OIT.jpg","released":"2026-01-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:2:3","season":2,"episode":3,"title":"Episodio 3","overview":"La batalla tiene consecuencias devastadoras y Mary revela a su nueva cómplice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dMBAGaJ8K8LZ0pthMjNlYc6a86R.jpg","released":"2026-01-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:2:4","season":2,"episode":4,"title":"Episodio 4","overview":"Vuelven las noches de peleas. Sugar debe tomar una decisión difícil y Sophie le pide ayuda a Mary.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6mE97l26QKKLfeP7itnHBYTJXOF.jpg","released":"2026-01-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"Episodio 5","overview":"Sugar se enfrenta a Treacle. El príncipe se enfrenta a su oponente y la vida de Mary está en riesgo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7x6Atlj8KeHLU90ErUlRLDcy7dh.jpg","released":"2026-01-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"45 min"},{"id":"tt21874900:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Episodio 6","overview":"La presión de Murtagh aumenta y las cosas llegan a un punto crítico para Hezekiah, Sugar y Mary.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aQOHLGWsU4XntCQPCk9ECdc4SDE.jpg","released":"2026-01-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"41 min"}]}}